## Notes

- EAS manages iOS certificates automatically when `credentialsSource` is
  `remote` in `eas.json`.
- Android keystore is auto-generated by EAS or can be supplied manually via
  `artifacts/cashclip/credentials/` (gitignored).
- See `GOOGLE_PLAY.md` for Play Console setup and `STORE_LISTING.md` for
  App Store / Play Store listing metadata.
